{"seq":2,"slug":"core-policies","title":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔·核心政策与主张","stage":"DONE","category":"mustafa-kemal-ataturk","categoryLabel":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/21_mustafa-kemal-ataturk/2_core-policies","introHtml":"<p>理解凯末尔，最直接的入口不是他的战功，而是他执政后亲手立下的那套制度。这个侧面只做一件事：把凯末尔从 1922 到 1937 年间推行的核心政策一项一项讲清楚——废除苏丹制、宣告共和、废除哈里发与教育统一、把&quot;世俗性&quot;一步步写进宪法、再到文字、服饰、历法、法律与妇女地位的全面西化。它关注的是&quot;政策本身是什么、怎么落地、依据哪部法律、在哪一天生效&quot;，而不是评判它的对错。</p>\n<p>它面向的是想弄清&quot;现代土耳其的制度骨架是怎么搭起来的&quot;的普通历史读者。每一项政策都尽量给出确切的年份、法律名称与机构名称（如 1924 年 3 月 3 日的《统一教育法》、同日设立的宗教事务局 Diyanet），让读者能按图索骥、自行核验，而不是停留在&quot;凯末尔很有魄力&quot;这类笼统的印象上。</p>\n<p>它与兄弟侧面分工明确：<a href=\"../life-and-career/\">生平与事业</a>叙述凯末尔从军官到&quot;国父&quot;的完整时间线；<a href=\"../political-thought/\">政治思想</a>梳理凯末尔主义六支箭的内在逻辑；<a href=\"../major-events/\">重大事件</a>聚焦加里波利、独立战争、文字改革等里程碑节点；<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与历史地位</a>评估这些改革留给土耳其与世界的长远遗产；<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>则专门处理&quot;该如何评判&quot;——尤其是世俗化的强制性与威权统治的代价。本侧面不替它们做价值判断，只负责把&quot;制度做了什么&quot;说明白；当某项政策伴随重大争议时，会给出指向争议侧面的链接，把&quot;是什么&quot;和&quot;该怎么看&quot;分开来读。</p>\n<p>三章依次展开：<a href=\"the-republic/\">共和国的建立</a>讲政治根基的更替——废苏丹、立共和；<a href=\"secularism/\">世俗主义</a>讲国家与宗教的切割——废哈里发、政教分离、laiklik 入宪；<a href=\"modernization/\">现代化</a>讲社会与生活层面的西化——文字、服饰、法律与妇女解放。三章合起来，构成凯末尔&quot;自上而下重塑一个国家&quot;的完整政策图谱。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic","title":"共和制","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abolishing-the-sultanate","title":"废除苏丹制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/abolishing-the-sultanate"},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-a-republic","title":"建立共和国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/the-republic/building-a-republic"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"secularism","title":"世俗化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"separating-mosque-and-state","title":"政教分离","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism/separating-mosque-and-state"},{"seq":2,"slug":"abolishing-the-caliphate","title":"废除哈里发制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/secularism/abolishing-the-caliphate"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modernization","title":"现代化改革","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/modernization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"westernizing-reforms","title":"西化改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/modernization/westernizing-reforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emancipating-women","title":"解放妇女","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/core-policies/modernization/emancipating-women"}]}]}